{title: Ruk Jana Nahi}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] ruk jana nahin,tu kahin [F#m] haar ke,        kanton [A] pe chalke [B] milenge saye [E] bahar ke
[E] o raahi [C#m] o raahi, o raahi [G#] o raahi,        [Cm] suraj dekh ruk gaya hain
[Cm] tere aage jhuk gaya hain,        jab kabhi [A] aise koi mastana
nikle hain apni [B] dhun main deewana,        [Cm] shaam suhane ban jate hain
[A] din intezaar [E] ke,        [E] o raahi [C#m] o raahi, o raahi [G#] o raahi
Saathi na carwaan hain,        Ye tera intehaan hain
Logo ko unka, sabkuch deke,        Tu to chala tha, sapne leke
Koi nahin to tere apne hain,        Sapne ye pyar ke....
O Raahi o raahi, O Raahi o raahi..
